<app-header title="登录" back transparent />

<view class="page login-page">
  <view class="login-mark"><text class="login-mark__en">SOLE MUSE</text><text class="login-mark__cn">让每一份鞋履灵感被看见</text></view>
  <view class="login-art glass-card">
    <image src="/assets/images/demo/artworks/artwork-06-yixiu-future.png" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="login-art__veil"></view>
    <text class="login-art__copy">步履所至，皆是灵感</text>
  </view>
  <view class="login-note glass-card">
    <text class="login-note__title">登录 SoleMuse</text>
    <text>登录后可以发布作品、点赞、收藏、评论，并管理你的创作档案。</text>
    <text class="login-note__dev">微信登录使用微信授权；手机号登录只提交微信返回的临时授权码。</text>
  </view>
  <button class="login-method login-method--wechat" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="handleWechatLogin">
    <text class="login-method__icon">微</text>
    <text>微信一键登录</text>
  </button>
  <button class="login-method login-method--phone" open-type="getPhoneNumber" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindgetphonenumber="handlePhoneLogin">
    <text class="login-method__icon">⌕</text>
    <text>手机号直接获取</text>
  </button>
  <text wx:if="{{loginError}}" class="login-error">{{loginError}}</text>
  <text class="login-agreement">继续即表示你知悉后续正式版本将提供隐私政策与用户协议。</text>
</view>
